Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you ants out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:37.61,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,000)\c&H49B8D1&\3c&H2C2FAE&\pos(943.992,365.628)}The Day of {\3c&HAD5A2D&\c&HFFFFFF&}Nobita's {\c&H49B8D1&\3c&H2C2FAE&}Birth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Mum doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very busy with cleaning and shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's summer vacation, why don't you help your mum by running errands?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really, because....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, today's August 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, your birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness is calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the footprints of my birthday gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to explain what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to remind you to "take the swim pants out of bag when dry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it instantly otherwise it's same as not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your homework? Did you finished it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously... ... You always say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You suffer like this always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But because today's....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's nothing special! \NDo this instant, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I WILL do it! Happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is with your tone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you always tell me to work hard that... I have lost my motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish you trust me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then will you study by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, you can study as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, we are believing in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to grow mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fault..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflect on your thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you did homework everyday, it'd never have ended up like this1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember raising you to be like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reflect yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!  should've ran from home after eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could stay somewhere else....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I'll visit Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to be my wife in the future after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe I'm a bit too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my. Wait, Shizuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like your dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that you're absorbed in your project, but the lunch is gonna be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take my hands off, have to finish it before evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then mother will feed you ..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,  open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy! Have bites!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:54.81,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940.984,740.698)}Gouda General Store
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding me, mum! It's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please gimme pocket money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuo're too strict on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put, I'll tie your raincoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I go !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful on the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to stay....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have reached the riverside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}! Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}! Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're speaking in Mum's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Never! Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you reflect upon yourslef?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd my parents want me back home when they don't even love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think your parents really love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've not been born only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're going too far, y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is my birthday, the day which disappointed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What really happened on the day you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it'll only increase sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What if your parents were happy on your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do if they were not happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Snail Shell-House!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you this shell, that you can forever call as your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! I'm coming with you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we scolded him a little too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see what he's doing now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier in time, this used to be my dad's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The desk is too new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you wouldn't be needing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, someone's on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, where's my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, but what are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad's very young and handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you forget the face of your own child?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you're not born yet. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Child?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I'd forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back running from work\Nafter I received the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, but you probably need to visit the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo 'copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.50,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100)\pos(987.042,677.209)}"The battery is dead"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere Door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:15.42,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100)\pos(977.041,731.349)}"Failure"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Tracking Tri-Cycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not babies anymore to ride on Tri-Cycle like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Never-mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to make it at this speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just press that button!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy is older than me and but still riding on a Tri-Cycle for babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Press the button on the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, press the button on the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes the scent of dad and catches up to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It runs the Shortest distance in ten times the speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten times the speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, can we really catch up with the dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it works out somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, we're on a train track! Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally back on a good ol' road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's running!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the hospital where I was born. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi! Mr. Nobi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, your wife has given birth to a baby boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Thanks for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This way please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so excited to see my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably looking like the present me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a big round face, just like his mother
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby's there, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us have a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He has wrinkles all over his face, and he looks like a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed a heartbeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Newly born children will have the same looks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with those children?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They're always following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what their parents have taught them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, where's my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she'll go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It Should be and you just missed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She was happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They are talking about Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for marrying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, then I forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's feeding time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Breast-feeding?\NAh, no father, as a matter of ~ ~
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what should we name our son?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought up of a decent name already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi Nobita, don't you like the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Nobi Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish they'd name me better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They should ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:16:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that! You'll be scolded again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:16:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The meaning of the name? Of course there are !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear! How beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you come to the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.26,0:17:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be looking at this tree
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this long branch of a tree extending smoothly...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,growing to the higher heights in a majestic way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It is really incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think , I can imagine it ..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he'll be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's an excellent kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:18:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be excellent in everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be good at sports if he's like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad just summarized all your weak points...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he be a scholar or a politician...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd have been nice if he became an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything is good, as long as as he be useful to society..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nobi Nobita, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I can't become like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to encourage me? That's very kind of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The tree is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No... !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! This tree was re-located.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a long branch of a tree Extending smoothly, growing to the higher heights...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he'll be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What about those books?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not necessary anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, seems I was wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where that tree is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that the tree's safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have grown up really!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But the books are gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind! I'm happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If Dad and Mum saw this, they Will definitely understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.10,0:22:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.73,0:22:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK? No injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We were dead worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's our fault that we went too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:22:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.64,0:22:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That tree was felled there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the sound of these leaves really takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Day Nobita was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels just like that tree, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A long branch of a tree Extending smoothly, growing to the higher heights...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Nobi Nobita! This is the origin of your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you glad that I was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, We are happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:24:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can see much farther if we could go up to the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.25,0:24:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elevator Button!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.91,0:24:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:56.85,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,I still remember that day when I first met you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:25:03.52,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,Being enveloped in the soft wind
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.38,0:25:09.68,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,You were there for me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:17.50,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,I have been wanting to see you\N from a very long time
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.89,0:25:24.47,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,Memories of that moment is not by chance
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.70,0:25:38.89,ED-Tl,,0,0,0,,I want to see you, my white angel\N with the shining face
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:44.64,End,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1900)\pos(999,659.07)}The End
